 The original response remains available. Evidence maps, multiple suggestions,
 required acknowledgements and executable suggestions retain their normal
 type checks.
+
+### Coupled run status ownership
+
+`coupled-status` is a read-only projection owned by `src/coupled_status.rs`. It
+reads the native `iterations.json` manifest and durable iteration ledgers without
+adding or changing persistent state. Task and wire request totals are derived
+from ledger records; an absent interrupted ledger remains unknown (`null`) rather
+than being treated as zero. The command reports recorded native completion only;
+it does not independently verify, qualify, or authorize promotion.
